@startuml user-admin-listing-sequence
title Listing & Akses Dokumen KYC Admin (Change A: add-user-admin-management)
' Sumber: dashboard-gap-analysis.md §2.5 + prd-dashboard.md §5.7 (FR-ADM-USR-01/02/05/06/08).
' Endpoint bertanda [BARU] adalah gap yang ditutup Change A (sebelumnya tidak ada di kode).

actor Admin
participant "rejki-web\n(Pengelolaan Pengguna)" as web
participant "require_admin\n(add-admin-rbac)" as rbac
participant "user-service\n/users/admin/kyc/*" as usvc
participant "RegionClient" as region
participant "StorageClient\n(presigned)" as stor
database "user_svc\n(profiles, kyc_submission,\ndocument_access_log)" as db
participant "NotificationClient" as notif

== Daftar pengajuan (FR-ADM-USR-01/08) ==
Admin -> web : buka halaman + filter/search/sort
web -> rbac : GET /users/admin/kyc?q&status&sort_by&sort_dir&limit&offset  [BARU]
rbac -> usvc : role=admin OK (default-deny)
usvc -> db : admin_list_submissions (filter/sort/paginate)
usvc -> region : resolve id wilayah (atau kirim id; UI resolve)
db --> web : ApiResponse + PaginatedMeta\n(NIK ter-mask, tanpa NIK penuh)

== Detail + click-to-view dokumen teraudit (FR-ADM-USR-02) ==
Admin -> web : klik ikon Mata → popup detail
web -> rbac : GET /users/admin/kyc/{id}  [BARU]
rbac -> usvc : role=admin OK
usvc --> web : detail (NIK ter-mask default)

Admin -> web : klik "view" Foto KTP / Selfie
web -> rbac : GET /users/admin/kyc/{id}/documents/{kind}  [BARU]
rbac -> usvc : role=admin OK
alt Dokumen tersedia
  usvc -> db : log_document_access(actor=admin, read_issued, request_id)
  usvc -> stor : request_download (presigned, TTL pendek)
  stor --> Admin : URL dokumen sementara
else Dokumen sudah dimusnahkan
  usvc --> web : tidak-tersedia (bukan 500)
end

== Review (reuse existing) + auto-purge saat tolak (FR-ADM-USR-05) ==
alt Tolak
  Admin -> web : klik Tolak + alasan
  web -> usvc : POST /users/admin/kyc/{id}/review {approved:false, note}
  usvc -> db : submission → rejected (guard: tolak bila sudah terminal)
  usvc -> stor : purge_documents (delete ktp + selfie)  [BARU: trigger otomatis]
  usvc -> db : clear_document_keys
  usvc -> notif : send (in-app) + send_email
else Terima
  Admin -> web : klik Terima
  web -> usvc : POST /users/admin/kyc/{id}/review {approved:true}
  usvc -> db : submission → approved
  usvc -> notif : send (in-app) + send_email
end

note over web : Export CSV: GET /users/admin/kyc/export.csv  [BARU] (ikuti filter aktif)
note over usvc : Setelah verifikasi, submission TERKUNCI (FR-ADM-USR-06).
@enduml
